[00:01:23.456] Browser LOG     products report {"data":{"products":[{"category":{"id":"38a64c65-23ed-4af2-a9ce-88e2ba9c1fe9","name":"Smart Gadgets"},"categoryId":"38a64c65-23ed-4af2-a9ce-88e2ba9c1fe9","createdAt":"2025-12-05T08:11:17.063Z","description":"Touchscreen Charge Case – Control calls, mute, ANC, and pairing directly from the smart case.\r\nSeamless PC & Mobile Connectivity – Connect to PCs (via BT700 adapter), smartphones, and tablets effortlessly.\r\nQi Wireless Charging – Convenient wireless charging support for the case.\r\nBT700 USB Bluetooth Adapter – Enables long-range (up to 98 ft) stable connections to laptops and desktops.\r\nSix-Microphone Array + WindSmart – Enhanced call clarity with advanced noise suppression.\r\nAdaptive Hybrid ANC – Blocks distractions with adjustable noise cancellation modes.\r\nPoly NoiseBlockAI – Reduces background noise intelligently for professional calls.\r\nMultipoint Pairing – Connect and switch between multiple devices (PC, Android, iPhone).\r\nLong Battery Life – Up to 5.5 hrs of use per charge, with 16 hrs additional playback from the case.\r\nUC Platform Certified – Optimized for Teams, Zoom, Google Meet, and more.","discountPercentage":null,"id":"ca245792-5cf3-4c71-b229-73b68a4222b8","imageUrls":["https://pub-35c12dbcf31e4b769c72ed554b2e702d.r2.dev/products/1764922276505-no0uw5g5thh.webp"],"isActive":true,"label":null,"name":"Poly   Voyager   Free   60+   UC   -   Touchscreen   True   Wireless   Earbuds","oldPrice":40000,"price":33999,"stock":20,"updatedAt":"2025-12-05T08:11:17.063Z"},{"category":{"id":"38a64c65-23ed-4af2-a9ce-88e2ba9c1fe9","name":"Smart Gadgets"},"categoryId":"38a64c65-23ed-4af2-a9ce-88e2ba9c1fe9","createdAt":"2025-12-05T08:02:43.550Z","description":"Steerable Two‑Mic Array – Microphone pickup up to 5 ft (1.5 m), focusing on voice while minimizing background noise.\r\nFull‑Duplex Audio – Enables natural, two-way conversations without interruptions.\r\n50 mm Speaker + Dual Passive Radiators – Delivers high-fidelity sound suitable for both speech and entertainment.\r\nTouch Controls & LED Status Bar – Intuitive interface for calls, volume, mute, and status visibility.\r\nUSB-A with USB-C Adapter – Plug-and-play connectivity across PCs and Macs; no external power needed.\r\nIP64 Dust & Water Resistant – Durable build for use in varied environments.\r\nPlatform Certified – Works seamlessly with Zoom, Microsoft Teams (Teams version includes dedicated Teams button), and more.\r\nSmart Management via Poly Lens – Easily manage settings, firmware, and device insights remotely.","discountPercentage":null,"id":"6d6d24ed-5a77-4300-ad4d-4f3d7f1f858f","imageUrls":["https://pub-35c12dbcf31e4b769c72ed554b2e702d.r2.dev/products/1764921762772-s28sev83cil.jpg"],"isActive":true,"label":null,"name":"Poly   Sync   10   Professional   USB   Conference   Speaker","oldPrice":50000,"price":43999,"stock":199,"updatedAt":"2025-12-05T08:02:43.550Z"},{"category":{"id":"38a64c65-23ed-4af2-a9ce-88e2ba9c1fe9","name":"Smart Gadgets"},"categoryId":"38a64c65-23ed-4af2-a9ce-88e2ba9c1fe9","createdAt":"2025-12-05T07:55:01.157Z","description":"Poly Savi 8445 delivers flexible comfort, continuous talk time, wide-reaching DECT coverage, and seamless multi-device integration—all built for hybrid professionals who demand versatility and performance.","discountPercentage":20,"id":"7a9b888b-5ee9-4ac9-a057-0bf4c55d3286","imageUrls":["https://pub-35c12dbcf31e4b769c72ed554b2e702d.r2.dev/products/1764921298650-8jx20zswbv9.webp"],"isActive":true,"label":null,"name":"Poly   Savi   8445   Office   Wireless   Dect   Headset","oldPrice":125000,"price":100000,"stock":39,"updatedAt":"2025-12-05T07:55:01.157Z"},{"category":{"id":"122ee78d-1aba-4c4f-8e52-00357c23a1c9","name":"Phones"},"categoryId":"122ee78d-1aba-4c4f-8e52-00357c23a1c9","createdAt":"2025-12-05T07:44:08.625Z","description":"The 128GB Apple iPhone XR in Sky Blue provides ample storage for all your apps, photos, and videos. With its powerful processo